  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Defining Data Models**\n\nI\'m now focusing on designing the core data models and architecture. I\'ve started organizing packages within `app/src/main/java/com/example/`. I\'ve created a `data/model/` package, and I\'m currently designing the `DocumentEntity.kt` Room Entity, considering fields like `id`, `title`, `folderName`, and `category` (RECEIPT, INVOICE, ID, etc.).\n\n\n**Refining Data Entities**\n\nI\'m now diving deeper into the database schema. I\'ve fleshed out the `DocumentEntity`, considering fields beyond the basics, like `pageCount`, `tagsJson`, and metadata for thumbnails and suggested titles. The `PageEntity` is next, focusing on image processing data. I\'m also planning the `SignatureEntity` for signature management, and the `FolderEntity` to support predefined and custom folders. I\'m establishing the `DocScanDatabase` and DAO interfaces for Room. Repository design is underway, too.\n\n\n**Developing Image Processing**\n\nI\'m now focusing on image processing tools. I\'ve defined `DocumentQuad.kt` for corner representation. I\'m building `ImageProcessor.kt` with perspective warp, color matrices, and rotation features. I\'m adding a Document Quality Evaluator, too. Then, `DocumentDetector.kt` is next, for edge and contour detection. I am also working on OCR processing.\n\n\n"
