    thinking: "**Analyzing Badge Implementations**\n\nI\'ve been examining how `BadgedBox` in Material 3 handles its `badge` parameter. Initially, I was wrestling with the requirement for `@Composable () -> Unit` when the badge might be conditionally absent. This led to awkward workarounds when `uiState.trashDocuments` was empty. Now I\'m working on applying the M3 standard pattern, which should produce better outcomes.\n\n\n"
