  planner_response {
    response: "All automated unit and Robolectric tests have executed and passed with `BUILD SUCCESSFUL`. The code has been refined with modern Material 3 APIs and directional icon mirroring.\n\n### Key Highlights of the Architecture:\n\n1. **Computer Vision & Capture Engine**:\n   - Sub-frame boundary edge detection with drift calculation.\n   - Hands-free auto-capture upon achieving stability.\n   - Projective homography matrix mapping (`Matrix.setPolyToPoly`) for 4-corner perspective unskewing.\n   - 2.5x magnification crosshair loupe for touch corner alignment.\n   - Single, Batch (with live thumbnail tray), ID Card (front + back), and Receipt modes.\n\n2. **Quality & Image Enhancement Pipeline**:\n   - Laplacian edge gradient variance and luminance analysis for blur/darkness quality reports.\n   - Filters: Magic Color (unsharp mask with saturation enhancement), Clean Document (background whitening), High-Contrast B&W binarization, Grayscale, and Vibrant.\n\n3. **OCR & Document AI**:\n   - Dual-engine: Local offline entity extraction (dates, totals, invoice IDs) and deep multimodal Gemini 2.5 Flash transcription with smart title and category generation.\n   - Indexed in local SQLite/Room for instant full-text search.\n\n4. **Multi-Page PDF & Annotation Studio**:\n   - Native Android `PdfDocument` generation with A4, Letter, and Fit formats, configurable compression, and invisible searchable text overlay.\n   - Freehand pen, translucent highlighter, transparent electronic signatures, and permanent blackout redaction.\n\n5. **Security & Data Isolation**:\n   - 100% offline-first local sandbox storage.\n   - 4-digit PIN app lock.\n   - Storage dashboard with temporary cache wiping and trash management."
    modified_response: "All automated unit and Robolectric tests have executed and passed with `BUILD SUCCESSFUL`. The code has been refined with modern Material 3 APIs and directional icon mirroring.\n\n### Key Highlights of the Architecture:\n\n1. **Computer Vision & Capture Engine**:\n   - Sub-frame boundary edge detection with drift calculation.\n   - Hands-free auto-capture upon achieving stability.\n   - Projective homography matrix mapping (`Matrix.setPolyToPoly`) for 4-corner perspective unskewing.\n   - 2.5x magnification crosshair loupe for touch corner alignment.\n   - Single, Batch (with live thumbnail tray), ID Card (front + back), and Receipt modes.\n\n2. **Quality & Image Enhancement Pipeline**:\n   - Laplacian edge gradient variance and luminance analysis for blur/darkness quality reports.\n   - Filters: Magic Color (unsharp mask with saturation enhancement), Clean Document (background whitening), High-Contrast B&W binarization, Grayscale, and Vibrant.\n\n3. **OCR & Document AI**:\n   - Dual-engine: Local offline entity extraction (dates, totals, invoice IDs) and deep multimodal Gemini 2.5 Flash transcription with smart title and category generation.\n   - Indexed in local SQLite/Room for instant full-text search.\n\n4. **Multi-Page PDF & Annotation Studio**:\n   - Native Android `PdfDocument` generation with A4, Letter, and Fit formats, configurable compression, and invisible searchable text overlay.\n   - Freehand pen, translucent highlighter, transparent electronic signatures, and permanent blackout redaction.\n\n5. **Security & Data Isolation**:\n   - 100% offline-first local sandbox storage.\n   - 4-digit PIN app lock.\n   - Storage dashboard with temporary cache wiping and trash management."
